+# IERAUI notices
+
+Illiterally's Enhanced Rules Analysis UI (IERAUI) is a UI Addon for Forge, by Illiterally. Modifications were made in September 2026 with OpenAI Codex assistance.
+
+Forge and its contributors created the underlying program. Upstream: https://github.com/Card-Forge/forge. Base revision: `a37a865a53280dd8ad6fad3384d69611e8c5a42f` (Forge 2.0.14). Existing source copyright notices are retained.
+
+Forge code and these modifications are provided under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later. See the included LICENSE. The release's exact source, required build files, and installation instructions are available through https://github.com/Illiterally/IERAUI/releases/tag/v0.1.12 at no additional charge.
+
+The addon JAR contains only changed/new Forge classes and their nested classes. Forge's other code and third-party libraries are supplied by the separate official Forge distribution and retain their existing licenses and notices. No Java runtime, card-art collection, personal user data, or third-party library binaries are bundled in the addon ZIP.
+
+Magic: The Gathering and associated material belong to their respective rights holders. This addon is independently made and is not endorsed by Forge's maintainers or Wizards of the Coast. Forge's code license grants no rights to separately owned artwork or trademarks.
